{"suttaId":"tha-ap224","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7809,7827],"vripara":"6"},"segments":{"tha-ap224:0.3":"Ajinadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap224:1.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, gaṇasatthārako ahaṃ;","tha-ap224:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ.","tha-ap224:2.1":"“Cammakhaṇḍaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, sikhino lokabandhuno;","tha-ap224:2.3":"Tena kammena dvipadinda, lokajeṭṭha narāsabha.","tha-ap224:3.1":"“Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, kilese jhāpayiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap224:3.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ, sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap224:4.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, ajinaṃ yaṃ adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap224:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ajinassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap224:5.1":"“Ito pañcamake kappe, rājā āsiṃ sudāyako;","tha-ap224:5.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap224:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap224:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ajinadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap224:8.1":"Ajinadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
